%% Notes, actors, autonumber, activation and nested fragments.
%%{init: {"theme": "forest"}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor user as End user (mobile, EU)
    participant web as Web app
    participant api as API Gateway — v2
    participant db as Orders DB
    Note left of user: Signed out
    Note over web,api: TLS 1.3, mutual auth
    user->>web: Open "My orders" & filter (last 30 days)
    activate web
    web->>api: GET /orders?since=30d#59; page=1
    loop paginate (until next_cursor is empty)
        api->>db: SELECT * FROM orders WHERE customer = $1 LIMIT 50
        alt rows found
            db-->>api: 50 rows
            opt cache warm
                api-)web: prefetch hint
            end
        else no rows
            db-->>api: empty
        end
    end
    par render
        api-->>web: 200 OK (JSON)
    and audit
        api-)db: INSERT audit_log
    end
    deactivate web
    web-->>user: Orders list
    Note right of db: a very long note that goes on and on so that layout and label measurement get a workout here
